## AI Agent Actions (UCP/MCP)

**Endpoint**: `https://bbcxmaster.com/api/ucp/mcp`

**Available Actions**:
- `search_products(query, filters)` - Find products by keyword, category, price, material
- `get_product_details(handle)` - Full product info including variants, images, specs
- `add_to_cart(product_id, variant_id, quantity)` - Add to cart
- `view_cart()` - Current cart contents
- `checkout(customer_info, shipping, payment)` - Complete purchase
- `track_order(order_number, email)` - Order tracking
- `initiate_return(order_number, items, reason)` - Start return process

**Filters**: category, price_range, material, color, size, in_stock

